WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.931
Tina: Okay. I just have to imagine Ginormous.

2
00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:23.562
Tina: I have to imagine being back there . . . with Hopian and Bello . . .

3
00:00:23.563 --> 00:00:31.569
Tina: I have to imagine being in their house . . . their backyard . . .

4
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:34.351
Tina: No no no no! I have to concentrate.

5
00:00:34.352 --> 00:00:36.879
My imagination is the key!

6
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.046
Tina: Okay. I'll imagine myself flying to Ginormous.

7
00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:46.347
Tina: I'm soaring through the air . . .

8
00:00:46.348 --> 00:00:49.671
Tina: Oh, Tina! Why can't you do this?

9
00:00:49.672 --> 00:00:56.947
You have to reach Hopian!

10
00:00:56.948 --> 00:00:59.528
Tina: Hopian?

11
00:00:59.529 --> 00:01:01.127
Dad: It's me, honey.

12
00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:02.892
I heard you crying.

13
00:01:02.893 --> 00:01:05.787
Tina: Oh. Hi, Dad.

14
00:01:05.788 --> 00:01:08.803
Dad: Did you call me . . . Hopian?

15
00:01:08.804 --> 00:01:11.903
Tina: Um. No, no, I said, "Come in."

16
00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.864
Dad: Oh. What's wrong, sweetheart?

17
00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:18.619
Tina: I'm just . . . I'm just frustrated.

18
00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:21.350
Dad: About the problem with your friend?

19
00:01:21.351 --> 00:01:24.124
Tina: I was trying to follow your advice.

20
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:28.554
Dad: You spoke to that older person that your friend respects?

21
00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:32.301
Tina: I was trying to find a way to reach him.

22
00:01:32.302 --> 00:01:34.191
Dad: To reach him, sweetie?

23
00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:36.324
I don't understand.

24
00:01:36.325 --> 00:01:41.375
Tina: He . . . he doesn't live in our world.

25
00:01:41.376 --> 00:01:45.554
Dad: Oh, I see. He's an imaginary friend.

26
00:01:45.555 --> 00:01:49.015
Tina: Something like that.

27
00:01:49.016 --> 00:01:52.647
Dad: Are you sure this person can help your angry friend?

28
00:01:52.648 --> 00:01:54.836
Tina: It's complicated, Dad.

29
00:01:54.837 --> 00:01:56.908
But yes, he can help.

30
00:01:56.909 --> 00:02:01.079
Dad: It sounds like you and your friends have a secret world.

31
00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.716
Tina: Kind of, I guess.

32
00:02:04.717 --> 00:02:08.198
Dad: Well, I won't ask too many questions.

33
00:02:08.199 --> 00:02:13.614
Tina: Thanks. But I don't know how to contact my friend from the other world.

34
00:02:13.615 --> 00:02:17.426
Dad: Well, why don't you just pretend he's here?

35
00:02:17.427 --> 00:02:21.281
Tina: Dad! I told you, it's more complicated than that.

36
00:02:21.282 --> 00:02:23.967
Dad: All right. Let's think.

37
00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:29.199
Dad: If you could do anything you imagined, how would you [n3@get to your friend's world?

38
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.071
Tina: I don't know.

39
00:02:31.072 --> 00:02:33.951
Dad: If you could do anything . . .

40
00:02:33.952 --> 00:02:37.161
Tina: If I could do anything . . .

41
00:02:37.162 --> 00:02:39.018
Dad: Yes.

42
00:02:39.019 --> 00:02:44.096
Tina: I . . . I don't know . . .

43
00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:46.167
Dad: I love you, sweetheart.

44
00:02:46.168 --> 00:02:48.843
Tina: But I thought you were going to help me.

45
00:02:48.844 --> 00:02:51.185
Dad: I think you already know the answer.

46
00:02:51.186 --> 00:02:54.281
And dads can't know everything.

47
00:02:54.282 --> 00:02:56.048
Tina: Good night, Daddy.

48
00:02:56.049 --> 00:02:58.587
Dad: Good night.

49
00:02:58.588 --> 00:03:01.397
Tina: If I could do anything . . .

50
00:03:01.398 --> 00:03:04.513
If I could do anything . . .

51
00:03:04.514 --> 00:03:09.467
Tina: I would . . . I would run as fast as the wind . . .

52
00:03:09.468 --> 00:03:14.488
Tina: I would run as fast as the wind!
